<h2 id="what-zeroipc-is-good-for">What ZeroIPC Is Good For</h2>
<p>✅ High-frequency sensor data sharing
✅ Multi-process simulations
✅ Real-time analytics pipelines
✅ Cross-language scientific computing
✅ Reactive event processing
✅ Zero-copy producer-consumer patterns</p>
<h2 id="what-zeroipc-is-not-for">What ZeroIPC Is Not For</h2>
<p>❌ General-purpose memory allocation
❌ Network-distributed systems
❌ Persistent storage
❌ Garbage collection</p>
